WEBVTT

00:00:00.370 --> 00:00:04.040
Just being at your side,

00:00:04.150 --> 00:00:16.160
Gentles my hearts to the point of disbelief

00:00:17.980 --> 00:00:25.570
I thought I heard the sound of your footsteps behind me,

00:00:27.030 --> 00:00:35.720
I turned my head repeatedly, wishing you would appear...

00:00:36.430 --> 00:00:41.740
...and then there you were

00:00:42.920 --> 00:00:50.990
The beginning of a new love

00:00:51.310 --> 00:01:05.870
Is unknowingly, the beginning of our invisible love story

00:01:07.930 --> 00:01:15.360
Hence, I shall never leave your side

00:01:16.000 --> 00:01:24.540
I pledge to love you and only you

00:01:48.200 --> 00:01:49.600
'Morning, Shuji.

00:01:49.670 --> 00:01:51.360
Sorry! I got held up.

00:01:53.270 --> 00:01:56.440
It's OK. Shall we go?

00:01:58.540 --> 00:02:01.270
Are you alright? It's OK if we're a bit late.

00:02:02.180 --> 00:02:06.520
Don't worry. I can keep up.

00:02:13.960 --> 00:02:21.630
<i>My girlfriend, Chise.</i> <i>That day, she was...slow like always.</i>

00:02:25.640 --> 00:02:29.030
"I'm Growing.."<b></b>

00:02:36.180 --> 00:02:40.880
So you see, I've become this ultimate weapon.

00:02:41.550 --> 00:02:42.380
I see.

00:02:43.190 --> 00:02:45.420
So... what exactly is that?

00:02:46.390 --> 00:02:48.450
I don't really understand, myself.

00:02:49.160 --> 00:02:52.690
All these important-looking people explained it,

00:02:52.970 --> 00:02:54.830
but they used such difficult words...

00:02:56.740 --> 00:02:57.700
I'm sorry...

00:02:59.000 --> 00:03:01.870
Well, it's OK with me, but...

00:03:02.270 --> 00:03:05.240
you can be changed back, though...

00:03:10.350 --> 00:03:11.870
I forgot to ask that!

00:03:12.320 --> 00:03:13.410
Forgot to ask?!

00:03:13.790 --> 00:03:17.750
I'll ask them next time I go for training!

00:03:20.230 --> 00:03:21.890
When I finally woke up,

00:03:21.960 --> 00:03:24.330
I'd been moved to a military base,

00:03:24.960 --> 00:03:28.900
so I never met the people who did this to me...

00:03:29.900 --> 00:03:32.530
So next time, I'll ask them.

00:03:33.440 --> 00:03:34.460
Sorry about that...

00:03:35.010 --> 00:03:37.670
That's OK...

00:03:39.670 --> 00:03:40.510
Shuji!

00:03:41.520 --> 00:03:42.840
I made you lunch!

00:03:45.880 --> 00:03:49.410
I don't know if it's any good, but...

00:03:49.590 --> 00:03:53.820
I asked Akemi what a girlfriend is supposed to do,

00:03:54.330 --> 00:03:56.620
and she said I should make you lunch.

00:03:57.600 --> 00:03:59.500
If you don't like it you don't have to eat it.

00:04:00.730 --> 00:04:01.960
I want to eat it now!

00:04:10.310 --> 00:04:11.940
What's that? A pager?

00:04:12.310 --> 00:04:13.240
Uh, yeah...

00:04:13.910 --> 00:04:14.640
From home?

00:04:15.510 --> 00:04:18.610
Uh, no. It's from the military.

00:04:20.490 --> 00:04:25.220
I always have to carry it in case there's an incident.

00:04:25.660 --> 00:04:26.720
An "incident"?

00:04:28.260 --> 00:04:30.050
Like a... war...

00:04:31.400 --> 00:04:32.640
But don't worry!

00:04:33.300 --> 00:04:36.830
They won't call me unless they really need to.

00:04:37.340 --> 00:04:39.240
I don't have any classes this afternoon, anyway.

00:04:41.340 --> 00:04:43.710
I've got to go now, Shuji.

00:04:44.410 --> 00:04:45.500
But don't worry!

00:04:45.940 --> 00:04:47.210
Uh... OK...

00:04:48.750 --> 00:04:49.360
See you later!

00:04:50.850 --> 00:04:51.440
Oops!

00:05:01.890 --> 00:05:03.600
<b>Shuji</b>

00:05:08.870 --> 00:05:12.360
<i>It's been one week since</i> <i>the air raid on Sapporo.</i>

00:05:14.180 --> 00:05:16.150
Teachers' Room

00:05:19.690 --> 00:05:22.650
<b>Disaster in Sapporo!! One week later...</b>

00:05:23.820 --> 00:05:26.880
<i>Missing: 66,300</i>

00:05:41.570 --> 00:05:43.190
Nice lunch! Homemade too!

00:05:43.270 --> 00:05:44.830
Wow, so lucky!

00:05:46.270 --> 00:05:47.500
Hey, hands off!

00:05:47.810 --> 00:05:52.680
These days, only the military gets to have meat in their lunch.

00:05:56.110 --> 00:05:58.480
It's kind of burnt, though.

00:05:58.610 --> 00:06:00.480
Then don't eat it!

00:06:00.850 --> 00:06:01.820
Cut it out!

00:06:02.250 --> 00:06:03.690
Oh, come on!

00:06:04.120 --> 00:06:06.980
<i>There was an unspoken</i> <i>agreement...</i>

00:06:07.860 --> 00:06:09.720
<i>that we wouldn't talk</i> <i>about the air raid.</i>

00:06:10.900 --> 00:06:15.460
<i>Because we knew, neither talking about,</i> <i>nor remembering the dead</i>

00:06:16.130 --> 00:06:19.470
<i>would change what was happening.</i>

00:06:41.990 --> 00:06:44.460
<i>"You've been so nice</i> <i>to me lately, Shuji..."</i>

00:06:45.230 --> 00:06:48.930
<i>"but it makes me worry</i> <i>when you smile so much."</i>

00:06:49.910 --> 00:06:56.070
<i>"When I see you force a smile,</i> <i>I just want to disappear."</i>

00:06:57.140 --> 00:06:59.980
<i>"Why does my body</i> <i>have to be like this?"</i>

00:07:01.180 --> 00:07:07.280
<i>"Maybe I did something wrong.</i> <i>Maybe this is some kind of punishment."</i>

00:07:08.530 --> 00:07:12.020
<i>"Keeping it a secret that</i> <i>I'm an 'Ultimate Weapon' is hard..."</i>

00:07:12.390 --> 00:07:15.290
<i>"because I can't talk to anyone about it."</i>

00:07:16.830 --> 00:07:18.420
<i>"That's why, on that day..."</i>

00:07:21.170 --> 00:07:25.760
<i>"I was embarrassed to be seen</i> <i>by anyone, especially you, Shuji."</i>

00:07:25.840 --> 00:07:27.130
Shuji! Dinner!

00:07:27.240 --> 00:07:29.540
<i>"But, it was a relief</i> <i>when you did."</i>

00:07:31.310 --> 00:07:34.240
<i>"I thought that you'd get</i> <i>mad at me, Shuji,"</i>

00:07:34.750 --> 00:07:36.700
<i>"for all the things I'm doing."</i>

00:07:37.850 --> 00:07:41.980
<i>"Since that day, you've lied for me</i> <i>and been so kind..."</i>

00:07:42.750 --> 00:07:45.990
<i>"It made me feel very happy,</i> <i>but also...sad."</i>

00:07:46.930 --> 00:07:50.590
<i>"But it's OK. I'm getting stronger!"</i>

00:07:51.000 --> 00:07:53.770
<i>"Much, much stronger.</i> <i>So don't worry."</i>

00:07:55.000 --> 00:07:59.230
<i>"It hasn't been long,</i> <i>but thank you for going out with me."</i>

00:08:00.470 --> 00:08:01.400
<i>"I'm sorry."</i>

00:08:15.940 --> 00:08:19.320
<i>Suddenly, I understood.</i>

00:08:32.400 --> 00:08:34.200
Are you OK, Chise?!

00:08:37.910 --> 00:08:39.000
I'm... I'm sorry.

00:08:43.980 --> 00:08:48.650
<i>I hadn't seen Chise like that</i> <i>since that first time.</i>

00:08:49.720 --> 00:08:53.820
<i>I realized that trying to think of this</i> <i>as a bad dream...</i>

00:08:54.390 --> 00:08:56.380
<i>would only hurt her more.</i>

00:08:58.230 --> 00:08:59.090
I'm home!

00:09:08.510 --> 00:09:09.000
Idiot!

00:09:09.670 --> 00:09:11.770
What are you thinking, coming home like that?!

00:09:12.080 --> 00:09:14.170
What if someone saw you?!

00:09:14.980 --> 00:09:16.450
I... I'm sorry.

00:09:16.520 --> 00:09:17.610
Sorry's not good enough!

00:09:17.850 --> 00:09:21.720
Sorry! I was worried I wouldn't make curfew!

00:09:22.500 --> 00:09:23.080
Chise!

00:09:25.690 --> 00:09:26.450
Welcome home.

00:09:29.090 --> 00:09:30.060
I'm home...

00:09:31.880 --> 00:09:34.260
The lunch was good.

00:09:38.150 --> 00:09:38.270
Traffic towards Sapporo is under regulation.

00:09:38.270 --> 00:09:44.210
Chise, this 'ultimate weapon' thing, what is it, exactly?

00:09:44.210 --> 00:09:45.590
Traffic towards Sapporo is under regulation.

00:09:45.590 --> 00:09:46.700
They told you, didn't they?

00:09:48.550 --> 00:09:50.980
The details are top secret.

00:09:51.850 --> 00:09:54.610
<i>I felt stupid to finally realize that...</i>

00:09:55.490 --> 00:09:57.680
<i>by hiding from</i> <i>the reality of the situation...</i>

00:09:58.120 --> 00:10:01.390
<i>I was hurting Chise and</i> <i>leaving her alone to deal with it.</i>

00:10:02.360 --> 00:10:07.670
You're the only one who knows I've become an ultimate weapon.

00:10:08.070 --> 00:10:11.500
Not my father, not my mother, or my little brother.

00:10:12.590 --> 00:10:16.470
The higher-ups said I shouldn't tell anyone...

00:10:16.810 --> 00:10:18.170
and I agree.

00:10:20.250 --> 00:10:22.010
Then don't.

00:10:23.950 --> 00:10:26.420
We're lovers.

00:10:29.620 --> 00:10:32.180
So it's fine if only we know.

00:10:37.160 --> 00:10:39.460
So it'll be our secret, right?

00:10:39.730 --> 00:10:43.530
Yeah. We won't tell our parents or anyone.

00:10:44.500 --> 00:10:47.060
<i>We both decided that...</i>

00:10:48.110 --> 00:10:52.540
<i>since we were lovers,</i> <i>we wouldn't tell anyone...</i>

00:10:53.210 --> 00:10:57.770
<i>and live out this reality together.</i>

00:10:58.950 --> 00:11:01.650
Shuji, I'm sorry.

00:11:02.220 --> 00:11:02.710
Dummy.

00:11:17.700 --> 00:11:18.230
Here!

00:11:36.390 --> 00:11:37.250
<i>"Shuji..."</i>

00:11:38.920 --> 00:11:39.650
<i>"I'm..."</i>

00:11:41.990 --> 00:11:43.220
<i>"growing..."</i>

00:12:02.470 --> 00:12:03.920
Chise's growing?!

00:12:03.940 --> 00:12:05.490
Idiot, keep your voice down!

00:12:06.890 --> 00:12:07.980
Quit staring!

00:12:08.700 --> 00:12:10.020
Growing, huh?

00:12:10.220 --> 00:12:13.020
She's getting breasts, I guess.

00:12:14.070 --> 00:12:16.250
So Chise's finally getting bigger...

00:12:18.000 --> 00:12:19.620
What do you mean, "finally"?!

00:12:21.870 --> 00:12:22.760
Earthquake?

00:12:22.830 --> 00:12:26.130
Not again! There're so many lately.

00:12:30.280 --> 00:12:31.260
Shuji!

00:12:31.680 --> 00:12:32.370
Yo.

00:12:35.480 --> 00:12:38.110
You should be setting an example for the lower classmen.

00:12:38.380 --> 00:12:39.680
Don't you know that, dummy?

00:12:40.920 --> 00:12:44.000
Your little sister's so much sweeter. You should take lessons from her.

00:12:44.620 --> 00:12:46.390
Otherwise you'll never get a boyfriend.

00:12:46.460 --> 00:12:47.860
None of your business!

00:12:49.930 --> 00:12:50.390
Hey!

00:12:50.660 --> 00:12:51.890
Just like old times, huh?

00:12:52.630 --> 00:12:56.570
Until two months ago, you and I used to lie here...

00:12:57.240 --> 00:12:59.400
and space out after practice.

00:13:00.910 --> 00:13:01.840
That's true.

00:13:02.910 --> 00:13:07.070
It feels strange after you quit the track team.

00:13:08.350 --> 00:13:09.310
Shuji?

00:13:11.980 --> 00:13:13.110
Have you and Chise done it?

00:13:14.550 --> 00:13:16.780
Why don't you just drop dead about ten times?!

00:13:17.990 --> 00:13:21.290
Say, are you two going to be OK?

00:13:21.530 --> 00:13:22.210
What do you mean?!

00:13:23.090 --> 00:13:26.210
I know about what's happening to Chise's body.

00:13:28.730 --> 00:13:31.860
You told her she's getting fat, didn't you?

00:13:33.170 --> 00:13:34.140
No, I didn't.

00:13:34.970 --> 00:13:40.880
She's not eating anything, lately. She gets dizzy and looks pale.

00:13:42.310 --> 00:13:45.370
You're supposed to be her boyfriend and you didn't even notice?

00:13:45.520 --> 00:13:49.080
She said she's on a diet, but I think there's more to it.

00:13:53.160 --> 00:13:54.420
I'm going now.

00:13:55.900 --> 00:13:58.090
Chise said she'll be waiting for you in the classroom.

00:14:04.100 --> 00:14:05.230
Ooh, cool!

00:14:05.740 --> 00:14:08.970
But yesterday, I saw one much cooler.

00:14:09.440 --> 00:14:13.310
I'd never seen one like it before, and it was all alone.

00:14:13.480 --> 00:14:14.990
Must be one of those, you know...

00:14:15.480 --> 00:14:17.410
real small ones that are hard to see...

00:14:17.680 --> 00:14:19.480
but super-fast, right?

00:14:19.920 --> 00:14:24.290
Uh, no. The one I saw was really huge!

00:14:29.380 --> 00:14:34.360
<i>Shuji...I'm...growing...</i>

00:14:55.690 --> 00:14:56.180
Chise!

00:15:02.730 --> 00:15:06.600
I'm sorry. I just couldn't take it any more.

00:15:09.430 --> 00:15:10.770
You idiot!

00:15:11.340 --> 00:15:12.130
Shuji...

00:15:13.200 --> 00:15:16.260
the more I go on, the bigger I grow.

00:15:18.040 --> 00:15:19.510
I'm getting stronger.

00:15:20.480 --> 00:15:24.010
I'm becoming more and more of a weapon!

00:15:24.950 --> 00:15:29.610
Yesterday, during this one attack, I...

00:15:33.990 --> 00:15:35.790
Enough! Don't say any more!

00:15:35.960 --> 00:15:40.800
I thought if I didn't eat I could slow it down...

00:15:40.870 --> 00:15:41.890
That's enough, I said!

00:15:44.040 --> 00:15:48.780
I don't know what to do...

00:15:48.970 --> 00:15:49.440
Chise!

00:15:51.140 --> 00:15:54.510
I don't know what my own body...

00:15:55.750 --> 00:15:57.310
is turning into!

00:16:15.400 --> 00:16:15.760
Chise...

00:16:17.170 --> 00:16:18.260
Shuji...

00:16:20.570 --> 00:16:21.330
No!

00:16:21.540 --> 00:16:23.300
Uh... sorry!

00:16:25.310 --> 00:16:27.400
They're watching me now.

00:16:31.050 --> 00:16:33.880
Recently, they've started observing me.

00:16:34.690 --> 00:16:38.520
I don't think they realize that I know,

00:16:39.590 --> 00:16:42.460
but, somehow I can tell.

00:16:43.030 --> 00:16:44.430
Who's watching?!

00:16:45.300 --> 00:16:49.630
Probably Japanese... or maybe some other country...

00:16:51.040 --> 00:16:54.800
Right now it's at 1 o'clock, about 300 meters away.

00:16:55.070 --> 00:16:55.840
But how?!

00:16:56.610 --> 00:16:59.300
Because I'm the ultimate weapon.

00:16:59.540 --> 00:17:02.980
But how can you just sit here knowing they're watching?!

00:17:03.820 --> 00:17:05.440
Because it's war.

00:17:05.980 --> 00:17:09.850
If I hang in there, maybe things will calm down.

00:17:10.790 --> 00:17:11.310
Dummy!

00:17:12.060 --> 00:17:16.190
What good will it do if you're an emotional wreck?!

00:17:18.020 --> 00:17:18.820
Shuji...

00:17:26.400 --> 00:17:27.280
Let's run away...

00:17:28.540 --> 00:17:29.610
Let's get out of here!

00:17:42.650 --> 00:17:47.090
<i>What I impulsively said</i> <i>would change both our fates.</i>

00:17:48.290 --> 00:17:51.730
<i>Looking back now,</i> <i>that was our last chance.</i>

00:18:04.840 --> 00:18:09.910
Enemy sighted: 43 degrees, 11 minutes, 14 seconds, 8 North...

00:18:09.980 --> 00:18:13.310
140 degrees, 59 minutes, 45 seconds, 1 East...

00:18:15.350 --> 00:18:16.220
and closing!

00:18:17.770 --> 00:18:18.450
Shuji!

00:18:19.020 --> 00:18:21.510
Turn left 250 meters ahead!

00:18:22.830 --> 00:18:23.490
Got it!

00:18:25.360 --> 00:18:28.300
<i>I noticed Chise had started acting strange.</i>

00:18:29.400 --> 00:18:30.420
Chise, what's wrong?!

00:18:31.240 --> 00:18:34.140
Nothing! Just keep watching the road!

00:18:36.710 --> 00:18:38.540
Shuji, look out!

00:18:39.080 --> 00:18:41.340
<i>Please...I don't know</i> <i>who you are...</i>

00:18:41.680 --> 00:18:43.770
<i>but stay away from us!</i>

00:18:44.380 --> 00:18:47.680
<i>Or I won't be able to</i> <i>control myself!</i>

00:18:48.950 --> 00:18:49.420
No!

00:18:50.350 --> 00:18:50.880
Chise!

00:18:51.360 --> 00:18:52.880
Don't look back!

00:18:53.680 --> 00:18:56.400
Please don't look at me!

00:18:58.430 --> 00:18:58.990
No...

00:19:09.710 --> 00:19:10.830
W-what's that?!

00:19:12.040 --> 00:19:14.530
Keep going, Shuji! Please don't look back!

00:19:15.050 --> 00:19:15.880
Go!

00:19:44.110 --> 00:19:46.630
It's OK. They're gone.

00:19:48.580 --> 00:19:54.680
What should we do now, Chise? Maybe try Tokyo or somewhere else?

00:19:55.320 --> 00:19:58.910
Shuji, Tokyo isn't there anymore...

00:20:00.160 --> 00:20:01.520
What, Chise?

00:20:02.260 --> 00:20:04.660
Sorry, Shuji. They've come for me.

00:20:04.830 --> 00:20:05.390
Choppers?

00:20:13.940 --> 00:20:17.340
It's alright. It seems they haven't spotted us yet.

00:20:18.280 --> 00:20:20.570
Chise, won't they see you?!

00:20:22.510 --> 00:20:24.210
<i>Before they do...I have to...</i>

00:20:31.820 --> 00:20:32.350
Chise!

00:20:33.420 --> 00:20:35.620
What were you going to do?!

00:20:37.330 --> 00:20:38.520
"What"?

00:20:40.160 --> 00:20:41.370
But I'm...

00:20:42.070 --> 00:20:43.230
a weapon!

00:20:45.370 --> 00:20:48.050
What do you think I'm doing?!

00:20:49.410 --> 00:20:52.470
You're the one who said to run away!

00:20:53.410 --> 00:20:55.330
That we do something!

00:20:57.750 --> 00:20:59.440
I don't like it either...

00:20:59.780 --> 00:21:02.550
but my body's a weapon!

00:21:04.360 --> 00:21:06.950
It won't let me just run away...

00:21:07.230 --> 00:21:08.350
it just... on it's own...

00:21:09.250 --> 00:21:11.190
Chise, earlier you didn't...

00:21:17.200 --> 00:21:22.660
Sorry, there's no such thing as a weapon that doesn't kill.

00:21:23.440 --> 00:21:24.200
Shuji...

00:21:26.340 --> 00:21:26.870
Huh?

00:21:28.080 --> 00:21:33.040
Maybe it's better... if I die...

00:21:48.630 --> 00:21:52.190
<i>"Why did my body have</i> <i>to become like this?"</i>

00:21:53.040 --> 00:21:59.570
<i>"Maybe I did something wrong.</i> <i>Maybe this is some kind of punishment."</i>

00:22:06.320 --> 00:22:08.480
No! Don't look at me!

00:22:13.260 --> 00:22:15.990
<i>The truth was much more</i> <i>profound than I had realized...</i>

00:22:16.760 --> 00:22:20.060
<i>and much more cruel.</i>

00:22:36.540 --> 00:22:43.420
A rift opened up upon my heart

00:22:43.790 --> 00:22:49.990
And I went through the night sleepless, sighing constantly

00:22:50.670 --> 00:22:59.340
Before I realize, it's turned to morning

00:23:02.280 --> 00:23:08.660
I want to hear your voice

00:23:09.180 --> 00:23:13.250
I want to feel your warmth

00:23:13.370 --> 00:23:19.460
Thoughts of you well up within me

00:23:20.640 --> 00:23:25.310
And my tears begin to overflow

00:23:25.320 --> 00:23:36.570
Goodbye my beloved, I am still unable to forget about you

00:23:36.730 --> 00:23:46.740
Having all of this end with just a single word of goodbye

00:23:47.240 --> 00:23:51.570
Fills me with sorrow

00:24:01.530 --> 00:24:03.190
Chise, we're leaving this place.

00:24:03.600 --> 00:24:06.090
The two of us will go somewhere where no one will find us.

00:24:06.470 --> 00:24:09.000
I'll wait for you. I'll always be waiting for you...

00:24:10.200 --> 00:24:15.080
"Together, Alone"
